":0.1,"f_score":7,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 7.4%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $279M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 26.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.83"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":97.32,"default_fair_val":97.32,"premium_pct":241,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":31.3,"pe_forward":27.5,"pb_trailing":3.1,"pb_forward":2.8,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":7.9,"fcf_to_ev":3.13,"fcf_to_mcap":3.15,"liab_to_assets":26.7,"cash_to_assets":5.3,"current_ratio":1.83,"roe":10,"roa":7.4,"moat":{"ticker":"SAIA","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Saia 在卡車運輸業中，品牌定價權相對有限。雖然其服務品質和可靠性贏得客戶信賴，但與FedEx、UPS等巨頭相比，品牌影響力尚有差距。在價格敏感的運輸市場，Saia 的定價策略更多是基於成本和市場競爭，而非強勢品牌溢價。其品牌價值主要體現在服務的穩定性和準時性上，這能吸引一部分對時效性要求高的客戶，但難以形成顯著的定價壁壘。相較於其他行業的領導者，Saia 的品牌護城河屬於中等水平，難以支撐長期顯著的價格優勢。","comment_en":"Saia has limited brand pricing power within the trucking industry. While its service quality and reliability earn customer trust, its brand influence lags behind giants like FedEx and UPS. In the price-sensitive transportation market, Saia's pricing strategy is more cost- and competition-driven than based on strong brand premiums. Its brand value is primarily reflected in service stability and punctuality, attracting some customers with high timeliness requirements, but it's difficult to form a significant pricing barrier. Compared to leaders in other industries, Saia's brand moat is moderate, making it hard to support a sustained significant pricing advantage."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"卡車運輸業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本投入、營運執照和安全法規，而非專利或獨特技術。Saia 作為一家成熟的運輸公司，擁有必要的營運許可和對行業法規的深刻理解，這構成了一定的進入門檻。然而，這些並非專利保護，競爭對手可以透過合規經營來獲取類似的資格。監管環境對行業有影響，但並未給予 Saia 獨特的、可持續的競爭優勢。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，Saia 的得分不高，屬於中等偏弱的水平。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the trucking industry primarily stem from capital investment, operating licenses, and safety regulations, rather than patents or unique technologies. As an established transportation company, Saia possesses the necessary operating permits and a deep understanding of industry regulations, which constitute a certain entry threshold. However, these are not patent protections, and competitors can obtain similar qualifications through compliant operations. While the regulatory environment impacts the industry, it does not grant Saia a unique, sustainable competitive advantage. Therefore, Saia scores low in patent and regulatory barriers, indicating a moderately weak level."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Saia 在客戶轉換成本方面具有一定的優勢。對於依賴穩定、可靠的貨運服務的企業客戶而言，更換供應商不僅涉及重新談判合約、尋找新合作夥伴的成本，還可能面臨服務中斷的風險，影響其自身生產和銷售鏈。Saia 長期建立的營運網絡和客戶關係，使得客戶在習慣其服務後，轉換的機會成本較高。雖然運輸業存在競爭，但對於尋求穩定性的客戶來說，Saia 的服務具有一定的黏性，構成了中等偏上的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"Saia possesses a certain advantage in customer switching costs. For corporate clients relying on stable and reliable freight services, changing suppliers involves not only the costs of renegotiating contracts and finding new partners but also the risk of service disruptions, impacting their own production and sales chains. The operational network and customer relationships Saia has built over time make the opportunity cost of switching relatively high once customers become accustomed to its services. Although the transportation industry is competitive, Saia's services offer a degree of stickiness for customers seeking stability, forming a moderately high switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"卡車運輸業的網絡效應相對有限，主要體現在貨運量的集中和路線的優化上。Saia 擁有廣泛的服務網絡，能夠處理更多貨物，從而提高營運效率和降低單位成本。然而，這種網絡效應更多是規模經濟的體現，而非典型的網絡效應，即用戶越多，服務價值越高的情況。雖然更多的貨運量可以帶來更好的路線匹配和更高的裝載率，但這並未形成像社交媒體或市場平台那樣的強烈正反饋循環。因此，其網絡效應的壁壘屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"Network effects in the trucking industry are relatively limited, primarily reflected in the concentration of freight volume and route optimization. Saia has an extensive service network, enabling it to handle more cargo, thereby improving operational efficiency and reducing unit costs. However, this network effect is more an embodiment of economies of scale rather than a typical network effect where more users enhance service value. While greater freight volume can lead to better route matching and higher load factors, it doesn't create a strong positive feedback loop like social media or marketplaces. Therefore, its network effect barrier is at a moderate level."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Saia 在規模成本方面具有顯著優勢。作為一家大型的區域性卡車運輸公司，其龐大的營運規模使其能夠在採購、車隊管理、路線規劃和人力資源等方面實現顯著的成本節約。更大的貨運量攤薄了固定成本，提高了車輛利用率，並可能獲得更有利的燃油和維護價格。這種規模經濟是運輸業的核心競爭力之一，使得小型競爭對手難以在成本上與之匹敵。Saia 持續的成長和效率提升，鞏固了其在成本結構上的領先地位，構成了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Saia possesses a significant advantage in economies of scale. As a large regional trucking company, its extensive operational scale allows for substantial cost savings in procurement, fleet management, route planning, and human resources. Higher freight volumes dilute fixed costs, improve vehicle utilization, and may secure more favorable prices for fuel and maintenance. This economy of scale is a core competitive strength in the transportation industry, making it difficult for smaller competitors to match its cost structure. Saia's continuous growth and efficiency improvements solidify its leading position in cost structure, forming a robust moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Saia 的地理覆蓋範圍廣泛，尤其在美國東南部和中西部地區擁有較強的市場地位。其密集的網絡和完善的基礎設施（如貨運站）構成了其營運的關鍵資產。然而，這些地理資產並非絕對獨特，其他大型運輸公司也可能在相似區域擁有廣泛佈局。其優勢更多體現在網絡的密度和效率上，而非某種不可複製的地理位置或資源。因此，在獨特地理資產方面，Saia 的護城河屬於中等水平，依賴於持續的網絡優化和服務質量。","comment_en":"Saia's geographical coverage is extensive, with a particularly strong market position in the southeastern and midwestern United States. Its dense network and well-developed infrastructure (such as terminals) constitute key operational assets. However, these geographical assets are not absolutely unique, as other large transportation companies may also have broad coverage in similar regions. Its advantage lies more in network density and efficiency rather than any irreplicable geographical location or resource. Therefore, in terms of unique geographical assets, Saia's moat is at a moderate level, relying on continuous network optimization and service quality."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Saia 在營運效率方面表現出色，這在其財務指標（如 ROE、ROA）和自由現金流生成能力上有所體現。公司持續投資於技術升級，例如路線優化軟體、車隊管理系統和自動化裝卸設備，以提高貨物處理速度和準確性，降低營運成本。其高效的營運能力是區別於競爭對手的關鍵，也是其能夠在價格競爭中保持盈利能力的基礎。這種對效率的持續追求和卓越的執行力，構成了其堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Saia demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its financial metrics (such as ROE, ROA) and free cash flow generation. The company continuously invests in technological upgrades, such as route optimization software, fleet management systems, and automated loading/unloading equipment, to enhance cargo handling speed and accuracy while reducing operational costs. Its efficient operational capability is a key differentiator from competitors and the foundation for maintaining profitability amidst price competition. This persistent pursuit of efficiency and outstanding execution constitute its robust moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Saia 的資本配置策略相對穩健。公司在保持健康的資產負債表（現金充足，負債可控）的同時，持續將資本投入於擴張網絡、更新車隊和提升技術。其自由現金流充裕，能夠支持有機增長和潛在的戰略性收購。管理層在追求規模擴張和維持盈利能力之間取得了良好平衡。雖然其資本配置策略並非極度激進，但其務實和聚焦於核心業務的原則，為公司長期穩健發展提供了保障，構成了中等偏上的護城河。","comment_en":"Saia's capital allocation strategy is relatively sound. While maintaining a healthy balance sheet (sufficient cash, manageable debt), the company consistently invests capital in expanding its network, modernizing its fleet, and enhancing technology. Its ample free cash flow supports organic growth and potential strategic acquisitions. Management strikes a good balance between pursuing scale expansion and maintaining profitability. Although its capital allocation strategy is not extremely aggressive, its pragmatic approach and focus on core business principles ensure the company's long-term stable development, forming a moderately high moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Saia 在客戶保留方面表現良好，這得益於其可靠的服務、廣泛的網絡覆蓋以及對客戶需求的響應能力。對於許多依賴其運輸服務的企業客戶而言，Saia 已成為其供應鏈中不可或缺的一部分。一旦客戶與 Saia 建立起穩定的合作關係，並習慣其服務標準和效率，轉換到其他供應商的意願和成本都會增加。這種基於信任和穩定性的客戶關係，構成了 Saia 的一個重要壁壘，使其能夠維持較高的客戶留存率。","comment_en":"Saia performs well in customer retention, thanks to its reliable service, extensive network coverage, and responsiveness to customer needs. For many corporate clients who depend on its transportation services, Saia has become an integral part of their supply chain. Once customers establish a stable cooperative relationship with Saia and become accustomed to its service standards and efficiency, their willingness and cost to switch to other providers increase. This customer relationship, built on trust and stability, forms a significant barrier for Saia, enabling it to maintain a high customer retention rate."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"卡車運輸行業具有一定的週期性，但 Saia 作為基礎設施服務提供商，其業務具有較強的韌性。經濟活動的恢復和發展離不開貨物運輸，這為 Saia 提供了穩定的需求基礎。儘管面臨宏觀經濟波動和燃油價格的影響，Saia 透過其規模優勢、營運效率和客戶黏性，能夠較好地抵禦外部衝擊。其持續的資本配置和對技術的投入，也為應對行業變革和保持長期競爭力奠定了基礎。因此，Saia 的業務模式具有中等偏上的持久性。","comment_en":"The trucking industry is somewhat cyclical, but as an infrastructure service provider, Saia's business exhibits considerable resilience. Economic activity recovery and development are inseparable from freight transportation, providing Saia with a stable demand base. Despite facing macroeconomic fluctuations and the impact of fuel prices, Saia can better withstand external shocks through its scale advantage, operational efficiency, and customer stickiness. Its continuous capital allocation and investment in technology also lay the foundation for adapting to industry changes and maintaining long-term competitiveness. Therefore, Saia's business model possesses moderately high durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Saia 的經濟護城河主要建立在其規模經濟和營運效率之上，這使其在成本控制方面具有顯著優勢，並能提供可靠穩定的服務。客戶轉換成本和客戶保留率也為其業務帶來了一定的黏性。然而，在品牌定價權、專利監管和網絡效應方面，其壁壘相對較弱。總體而言，Saia 屬於一個具有堅實成本優勢和良好營運能力的「收費橋」型企業，其護城河相對穩固，能夠在競爭激烈的運輸市場中持續獲利，但尚未達到頂級的特許經營權水平。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Saia's economic moat is primarily built upon its economies of scale and operational efficiency, granting it a significant cost control advantage and enabling the provision of reliable, stable services. Customer switching costs and retention rates also contribute to business stickiness. However, its barriers are relatively weaker in brand pricing power, patent/regulatory protection, and network effects. Overall, Saia can be characterized as a 'toll bridge' type enterprise with a solid cost advantage and strong operational capabilities. Its moat is relatively robust, allowing for sustained profitability in the competitive transportation market, though it has not yet reached the level of a top-tier franchise.","evidenceHash":"65043c8eaa520ccc4bfe157fbfbb87355b4313615bdd494787ff1c126b48fac1","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"65043c8eaa520ccc4bfe157fbfbb87355b4313615bdd494787ff1c126b48fac1","currentEvidenceHash":"65043c8eaa520ccc4bfe157fbfbb87355b4313615bdd494787ff1c126b48fac1"},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T13:00:26.112Z","evidenceHash":"594a6c62fbd7c17974a858a58c2b1cf84b0fabb2c33003331e4d8f327dc83216"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T13:00:26.112Z","evidenceHash":"594a6c62fbd7c17974a858a58c2b1cf84b0fabb2c33003331e4d8f327dc83216"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SAIA.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SAIA.png","website":"https://www.saia.com","ceo":"Frederick J. Holzgrefe","full_time_employees":"14500","description":"Saia, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a transportation company in North America. The company provides less-than-truckload services for shipments between 100 and 10,000 pounds. It also offers other value-added services, including brokered truckload, expedited transportation, and other logistics services. The company was formerly known as SCS Transportation, Inc. and changed its name to Saia, Inc. in July 2002. Saia, Inc. was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Johns Creek, Georgia.","description_en":"Saia, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a transportation company in North America. The company provides less-than-truckload services for shipments between 100 and 10,000 pounds. It also offers other value-added services, including brokered truckload, expedited transportation, and other logistics services. The company was formerly known as SCS Transportation, Inc. and changed its name to Saia, Inc. in July 2002. Saia, Inc. was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Johns Creek, Georgia.","description_zh":"Saia, Inc.（美股代碼：SAIA）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Trucking 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"11465 Johns Creek Parkway","city":"Johns Creek","state":"GA","zip":"30097","country":"US","phone":"770 232 5067","full_address":"11465 Johns Creek Parkway, 